  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "傳承"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\">作者：蔡天享</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"><br /></span></div>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi2oMhimf5Jz_4ae0vnwZj6lP87IWY9rqUXAoSjuvTzJ9D6Ig0F1y557lo6BySyDZhIuc3hcqv1V3-BHl8h_YnXYmepibwJjYO5eIUcJ0fz7EwQh8snOutFZxSQOfRc5wlvcJ7cD6v-8l3F/s1600/%25E7%2588%25B6%25E8%25A6%25AA%25E8%2594%25A1%25E9%2595%25B7%25E6%25B0%25B8%2528%25E6%2599%2582%25E5%25B9%25B460%25E6%25AD%25B2%2529kap%25E9%2595%25B7%25E5%25AD%25AB%25E5%25A5%25B3%25E8%2594%25A1%25E4%25BA%25AE%25E5%2584%2580%2528%25E4%25BD%2587%25E5%25B8%2583%25E8%25A2%258B%25E5%25B8%2583%25E5%25BA%25971989%2529.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1600\" data-original-width=\"1095\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi2oMhimf5Jz_4ae0vnwZj6lP87IWY9rqUXAoSjuvTzJ9D6Ig0F1y557lo6BySyDZhIuc3hcqv1V3-BHl8h_YnXYmepibwJjYO5eIUcJ0fz7EwQh8snOutFZxSQOfRc5wlvcJ7cD6v-8l3F/s640/%25E7%2588%25B6%25E8%25A6%25AA%25E8%2594%25A1%25E9%2595%25B7%25E6%25B0%25B8%2528%25E6%2599%2582%25E5%25B9%25B460%25E6%25AD%25B2%2529kap%25E9%2595%25B7%25E5%25AD%25AB%25E5%25A5%25B3%25E8%2594%25A1%25E4%25BA%25AE%25E5%2584%2580%2528%25E4%25BD%2587%25E5%25B8%2583%25E8%25A2%258B%25E5%25B8%2583%25E5%25BA%25971989%2529.jpg\" width=\"438\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">↑阿爸蔡長永（hit時60歲）kap大漢查某孫蔡亮儀，tī布袋布店。1989年hip--ê。</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\">「阿爸！阿爸！七早八早你穿kah tsiah-nī仔飄撇，是beh去佗位tshit-thô？」「Gōng囡仔！今仔日是正月初1，lán beh來廟--裡拜拜！」過年hit工ê透早，阿爸照鏡tng-leh打扮，抹面油、梳hái-kat-á頭、kat ne-kut-tái、穿se-bí-looh，我mā tuè leh歡喜。去到廟--裡，「佛祖啊！你tio̍h保庇厝內囡仔大細，ē-tàng平安、勇健、大趁錢。」Gún老爸顧leh kā佛祖hē願，我走去金爐hia燒金、放炮仔，tse是逐冬過年ê時，阿爸lóng ē tshuā我去做ê代誌。前無偌久，新正年頭，我koh再去廟--裡拜拜，gún阿爸tsit回無去，因為伊已經無tī--leh--ah。我tsiânn siàu念gún阿爸，siàu念伊拍拚huānn家kap注重人品ê堅持。</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"><br /></span></div>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgw6JyjNZIpnF0vvX72J659SsTDjecq4OPTf1Ns0bZG8g5po27F_zsVdk1quFx5qoQL4PpMyLNgC6sUZmgJrMD_p-YzlTZyI1abeqoYddx4X4KZdmbieakKm6sqLfJRb65y4eEaKplo2qEn/s1600/%25E7%2588%25B6%25E8%25A6%25AA%25E8%2594%25A1%25E9%2595%25B7%25E6%25B0%25B8%2528%25E6%2599%2582%25E5%25B9%25B460%25E6%25AD%25B2%2529%2528%25E5%25BE%258C%25E6%258E%2592%25E6%25AD%25A3%25E7%2588%25BF%25E7%25AC%25AC1%25E4%25B8%25AA%2529%25E6%258A%25B1%25E9%2595%25B7%25E5%25AD%25AB%25E5%25A5%25B3%25E8%2594%25A1%25E4%25BA%25AE%25E5%2584%2580_%25E6%25AF%258D%25E8%25A6%25AA%25E8%2594%25A1%25E9%2582%25B1%25E7%25B7%259E%2529%2528%25E5%25BE%258C%25E6%258E%2592%25E6%25AD%25A3%25E7%2588%25BF%25E7%25AC%25AC2%25E4%25B8%25AA%2529%25E6%258A%25B1%25E9%2595%25B7%25E5%25AD%25AB%25E8%2594%25A1%25E5%25AD%259F%25E9%258C%2595%2528%25E5%2589%258D%25E6%258E%2592%25E6%25AD%25A3%25E7%2588%25BF%25E7%25AC%25AC2%25E4%25B8%25AA%2529%2528%25E4%25BD%2587%25E5%25B8%2583%25E8%25A2%258B%25E5%25B8%2583%25E5%25BA%25971989%25291989.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1094\" data-original-width=\"1600\" height=\"436\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgw6JyjNZIpnF0vvX72J659SsTDjecq4OPTf1Ns0bZG8g5po27F_zsVdk1quFx5qoQL4PpMyLNgC6sUZmgJrMD_p-YzlTZyI1abeqoYddx4X4KZdmbieakKm6sqLfJRb65y4eEaKplo2qEn/s640/%25E7%2588%25B6%25E8%25A6%25AA%25E8%2594%25A1%25E9%2595%25B7%25E6%25B0%25B8%2528%25E6%2599%2582%25E5%25B9%25B460%25E6%25AD%25B2%2529%2528%25E5%25BE%258C%25E6%258E%2592%25E6%25AD%25A3%25E7%2588%25BF%25E7%25AC%25AC1%25E4%25B8%25AA%2529%25E6%258A%25B1%25E9%2595%25B7%25E5%25AD%25AB%25E5%25A5%25B3%25E8%2594%25A1%25E4%25BA%25AE%25E5%2584%2580_%25E6%25AF%258D%25E8%25A6%25AA%25E8%2594%25A1%25E9%2582%25B1%25E7%25B7%259E%2529%2528%25E5%25BE%258C%25E6%258E%2592%25E6%25AD%25A3%25E7%2588%25BF%25E7%25AC%25AC2%25E4%25B8%25AA%2529%25E6%258A%25B1%25E9%2595%25B7%25E5%25AD%25AB%25E8%2594%25A1%25E5%25AD%259F%25E9%258C%2595%2528%25E5%2589%258D%25E6%258E%2592%25E6%25AD%25A3%25E7%2588%25BF%25E7%25AC%25AC2%25E4%25B8%25AA%2529%2528%25E4%25BD%2587%25E5%25B8%2583%25E8%25A2%258B%25E5%25B8%2583%25E5%25BA%25971989%25291989.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">↑阿爸蔡長永（hit時60歲，後排正爿第一个）抱大漢查某孫蔡亮儀，阿母蔡邱緞（後排正爿第二个）抱大孫蔡孟錕，tī布袋布店。1989年hip--ê。</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\">Gún老爸少年ê時，是leh做賣布ê小生理，為著beh tshiânn養五个囡仔，逐工天拄拍phú仔光就出門，褪赤跤，用扁擔（pún-tann）擔tsiânn百斤ê布料，沿路行，沿路huah賣：「來--ooh！來買布--ooh！」扁擔雙頭teh重，sìm--leh sìm--leh，人mā tuè leh hián--leh hián--leh，行bē穩，啊汗ná流。有一回阿水伯--à兇兇狂狂m̄知leh趕啥，gún老爸kā huah來講：「阿水--à！Lín新婦拄kā你生一个查埔孫，tsiânn福氣neh！我tsia拄進一條āinn巾，kap大紅花，tsiânn喜氣，若來āinn lín孫，穩當是gâu大漢koh好io飼！」阿水伯聽kah是耳仔phak-phak-phak，錢jîm leh tàn hōo gún老爸，āinn巾提--leh，喙笑目笑就走--ah。M̄-koh，聽講阿水伯--à tńg去到厝，hōo阿水姆--à罵kah臭頭雞仔：「你tsit个膨肚短命--ê！叫你去買一罐仔牛奶粉thang泡hōo lán孫--ê lim，你suah買āinn巾tńg--來，暗頓tsit條āinn巾你tsiah提去哺--lah！」Gún老爸gâu講話，外交koh好，生理lóng做有成--ê khah濟，伊m̄驚艱苦，tse就是伊拍拚huānn家ê精神。</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"><br /></span></div>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj7z1Y5LgzHJHgwQdnjE5LeGYZwy5t5JID_I9nnoYsk75SllhZCKZIMhTWPxB2zMejmXMnyIaUwg5gVphJn95vxHPrDXWprth02CLi1RHmkZ9FnbBdg0LfcTIkTZygFCLHpBykNQlyxkSpR/s1600/%25E7%2588%25B6%25E8%25A6%25AA%25E8%2594%25A1%25E9%2595%25B7%25E6%25B0%25B8%25E6%2599%2582%25E5%25B9%25B445%25E6%25AD%25B2_%25E7%2581%25B0%25E9%259A%258E.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1110\" data-original-width=\"1600\" height=\"442\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj7z1Y5LgzHJHgwQdnjE5LeGYZwy5t5JID_I9nnoYsk75SllhZCKZIMhTWPxB2zMejmXMnyIaUwg5gVphJn95vxHPrDXWprth02CLi1RHmkZ9FnbBdg0LfcTIkTZygFCLHpBykNQlyxkSpR/s640/%25E7%2588%25B6%25E8%25A6%25AA%25E8%2594%25A1%25E9%2595%25B7%25E6%25B0%25B8%25E6%2599%2582%25E5%25B9%25B445%25E6%25AD%25B2_%25E7%2581%25B0%25E9%259A%258E.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">↑阿爸蔡長永（hit時45歲、正爿第四个）、阿公蔡廉（正爿第五个）、阿母蔡邱緞（正爿第三个）、大姊蔡秀菊（正爿第二个），tī布袋布店舊厝前。1974年hip--ê。</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\">俗語講：痟貪是ē按怎？Tio̍h！痟貪ē nǹg雞lam。Tsit句話我自做囡仔ê時，gún老爸就有教--我--ah，m̄-koh我付出悽慘ê代價。國校仔二年ê時，gún同窗--ê阿榮--ā招我去海邊仔tshit-thô，雙人跳落去一台塑膠棑仔頂kuân，塑膠棑仔是塑膠管縛做伙ê細隻漁船。阿榮--ā雄雄mooh一粒石頭出來khà塑膠管，khà做一phuè仔一phuè仔，我徛tī船仔邊leh看頭，若有人來就ài huah聲，thang好suan，過無偌久，塑膠phuè仔té kah規布袋--ah，兩个人提去賣歹銅舊錫，賣50箍，提去買冰、食四秀仔，有夠歡喜，bē輸猴山--a去食著弓蕉仝款。無疑悟隔tńg工，塑膠棑仔ê主人受氣受tua̍h來投gún老爸，gún老爸氣ka̍h，kā我ê手骨掠--leh，hit枝leh量布ê尺攑--leh就kā我sut--落-去，沿路行沿路sut，我ná哀：「我後kái m̄敢--ah！我後kái m̄敢--ah！」。去到主人家，我雙跤跪--落，會失禮，老爸目屎ná流：「你食著好膽藥仔，人牽m̄行，鬼牽liù-liù行，你細漢偷挽匏，大漢就ē偷牽牛。」老爸重--ê是人品，自hit kái了後到tann，我m̄敢koh貪人半項。</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"><br /></span></div>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgOMLcqpnX3Eb5LrpILGdro96RJrmC877HQZBc3xEIKRyNktVed9Os9xR70rtgs3N0ns__YcfuVtU32VQdgxXtVo6CIj_J-_Yr-frsTpWeLMCHz7Q9ZLcbUVyzfpWi7OUwMLLyfq9Ub5V0E/s1600/%25E7%2588%25B6%25E8%25A6%25AA%25E8%2594%25A1%25E9%2595%25B7%25E6%25B0%25B8%2528%25E6%2599%2582%25E5%25B9%25B478%25E6%25AD%25B2%2529%2528%25E6%25AD%25A3%25E7%2588%25BF%25E7%25AC%25AC3%25E4%25B8%25AA%2529kap%25E4%25BD%259C%25E8%2580%2585%25E8%2594%25A1%25E5%25A4%25A9%25E4%25BA%25AB%2528%25E6%25AD%25A3%25E7%2588%25BF%25E7%25AC%25AC2%25E4%25B8%25AA%2529kap%25E5%2585%2584%25E5%25A7%258A%2528%25E9%2597%259C%25E5%25AD%2590%25E5%25B6%25BA%25E6%25B0%25B4%25E7%2581%25AB%25E5%2590%258C%25E6%25BA%2590%25292007.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1200\" data-original-width=\"1600\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgOMLcqpnX3Eb5LrpILGdro96RJrmC877HQZBc3xEIKRyNktVed9Os9xR70rtgs3N0ns__YcfuVtU32VQdgxXtVo6CIj_J-_Yr-frsTpWeLMCHz7Q9ZLcbUVyzfpWi7OUwMLLyfq9Ub5V0E/s640/%25E7%2588%25B6%25E8%25A6%25AA%25E8%2594%25A1%25E9%2595%25B7%25E6%25B0%25B8%2528%25E6%2599%2582%25E5%25B9%25B478%25E6%25AD%25B2%2529%2528%25E6%25AD%25A3%25E7%2588%25BF%25E7%25AC%25AC3%25E4%25B8%25AA%2529kap%25E4%25BD%259C%25E8%2580%2585%25E8%2594%25A1%25E5%25A4%25A9%25E4%25BA%25AB%2528%25E6%25AD%25A3%25E7%2588%25BF%25E7%25AC%25AC2%25E4%25B8%25AA%2529kap%25E5%2585%2584%25E5%25A7%258A%2528%25E9%2597%259C%25E5%25AD%2590%25E5%25B6%25BA%25E6%25B0%25B4%25E7%2581%25AB%25E5%2590%258C%25E6%25BA%2590%25292007.JPG\" width=\"640\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">↑阿爸蔡長永（hit時78歲，正爿第三个）、作者蔡天享（正爿第二个）kap兄姊，tī關仔嶺（Kuan-á-niá）水火同源。2007年hip--ê。</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\">我是leh食政府ê頭路，負責發漁船仔掠魚ê執照，有相當ê權力，bē少人愛kā我phôo-phôo-thánn-thánn，有一回船公司ê頭家khà電話hōo我講：「Eh！蔡sàng，年tih-beh到--ah，我有tshuân一箱烏甕串（oo-àng-tshǹg）ê sa-sí-mih，beh kā你sueh多謝，勞煩你tsiah uat來gún公司提hannh！Ē記得ài家己留leh食，千萬m̄-thang送--人neh！」有sa-sí-mih，koh huan咐m̄-thang送--人，穩當是有藏紅包……，我tng-leh躊躇ê時，聽著耳甕仔邊有人leh唸講：「Bē使貪、bē使貪，痟貪是ē nǹg雞lam！」Tang時仔是gún老爸講--過ê話，bē輸leh kā我提醒，細漢ê時hōo gún老爸摃kah悽慘落魄ê代誌，我tsiah回魂tńg--來，m̄敢去提。</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"><br /></span></div>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgFu8C1j7mXn0w6UNMxeaemF98ZwQKgfrsiA5kMsyKRfmp3QlbjWc0AJukB6FAngmRab88hYkgg-v9Sww0prbo3gC4JfKMw8IF7sRNQqt2ocuMZJHYTGtACqX0cKBo5ihFjSgI7jJ6tY7K2/s1600/%25E7%2588%25B6%25E8%25A6%25AA%25E8%2594%25A1%25E9%2595%25B7%25E6%25B0%25B8%2528%25E6%2599%2582%25E5%25B9%25B486%25E6%25AD%25B2%2529%25E4%25BD%25AEin%25E5%25B0%258F%25E5%25BC%259F1%2528%25E5%2598%2589%25E7%25BE%25A9%25E5%25B8%2583%25E8%25A2%258B%25E5%258E%259D%25E5%25B8%2583%25E5%25BA%2597%25292015.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"958\" data-original-width=\"1600\" height=\"382\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgFu8C1j7mXn0w6UNMxeaemF98ZwQKgfrsiA5kMsyKRfmp3QlbjWc0AJukB6FAngmRab88hYkgg-v9Sww0prbo3gC4JfKMw8IF7sRNQqt2ocuMZJHYTGtACqX0cKBo5ihFjSgI7jJ6tY7K2/s640/%25E7%2588%25B6%25E8%25A6%25AA%25E8%2594%25A1%25E9%2595%25B7%25E6%25B0%25B8%2528%25E6%2599%2582%25E5%25B9%25B486%25E6%25AD%25B2%2529%25E4%25BD%25AEin%25E5%25B0%258F%25E5%25BC%259F1%2528%25E5%2598%2589%25E7%25BE%25A9%25E5%25B8%2583%25E8%25A2%258B%25E5%258E%259D%25E5%25B8%2583%25E5%25BA%2597%25292015.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">↑阿爸蔡長永（hit時86歲）kap in小弟，tī布袋布店。2015年hip--ê</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\">Gún老爸傳承hōo--我--ê是拍拚huānn家kap注重人品ê精神，我beh kā傳--落-去。以往過年，lóng是gún老爸tshuā我去廟--裡拜拜，tsit-má，換我tshuā我ê後生去，我求講：「佛祖啊！你tio̍h保庇厝內囡仔大細，ē-tàng平安、勇健、大趁錢。」我ê囡仔tī金爐邊--a leh燒金、放炮仔，就親像tng年，我倚tī gún老爸ê身軀邊仝款。「乖囝--ê，lín阿公伊tng年賣布，千辛萬苦，是為著beh顧規家伙仔ê腹肚，教我ài拍拚huānn家，tse是頭一層。第二，阿公注重人品，教我凡事「bē-sái貪」，ài靠家己趁，tsiah ē成功！我tsit-má tsiah有才調做一个處長級ê主管。」Gún老爸傳承hōo--我ê精神，是一塊上jió-toh ê布，我beh用伊留hōo--我ê hit枝尺來量，kā車做一領衫，一領人格四四正正ê衫，永遠傳hōo囝囝孫孫。</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"><br /></span>\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"><br /></span>\n<br />\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"margin: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\"><b>#台灣寫真&nbsp;</b></span><b style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">專欄，</b></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;; font-size: x-small;\"><b>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap傳統白話字</b></span><b style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">方案。</span></b></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div style=\"margin: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報314期，2020年5月出刊。</b></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div style=\"margin: 0px;\">\n<br /></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div style=\"margin: 0px;\">\n<br /></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div style=\"margin: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div style=\"margin: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3wrIhYsOOwJNPzsMyjmPbI9ddmSRJ_pqcuxGjmrXlJMqFxxpVrD6GXJGkN7wZj5MfSb2YRcg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fF5bhx</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div style=\"margin: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">線上捐款(單筆)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2Ffcycox&amp;h=AT0H6xWALxkqKTZY4xK9Odg526LM77N2q_ltt_Y8nC4_ki5ZoWyAjPPNaKyF6_djXJ_obDEOkx__7WMdaTUsGNOmfg_FDe_nfhDB9cW9M2iyHMHquKL9nqCFMpuMwCF5Gby8kOWjHu6nBgAoYPsZcF2smrFzZVzSNSg15gjibmTXy4sSPf6SrWMQHmUCH9xNvWH_NU1Wp9NzumavCiqfcj4T6os_JW-iktTbi7Rur82KNucjaugBeLf4yIkaMCU_vybvXjKVnWWUq5pAwuVuMCebZdM-rH__LgvZR9zWIlivnX_lBELOjpKo7-lDzasSyJI8UDxgBUsDYSi-TXAqb1moHrcCZPU9DgyiIg0Dl63KER-NQMuehP5AjqLfKITfoVoc9ZXFfr-BItslSWP-mplFEqq82MBwmXwrembzOg-5Qu2qNvQfpLqoI5tvIIN0U_ZNfMHNfcND0dHoyuXmvOdmELx6ODOh4GLkH8uxKdg8hAgwf6LsFQVFWT-8hoopqCulWayrSYRFDyon9I6G-w1eBkO9iWtohOpq8XEA05uL2v6-oh4pTr5QYdobVfeqArrNaSvWLrvE4cL1ci5n7zIes4NNv3dRAAgdx4wRiKX-0e6xJla9fe2ZTCOTyQsZEuUGrdmWYe2l7e4iCwc\" href=\"https://ppt.cc/fcycox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fcycox</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div style=\"margin: 0px;\">\n<br /></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div style=\"margin: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div style=\"margin: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div style=\"margin: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div style=\"margin: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div style=\"margin: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px;\">\n<div style=\"margin: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><br /></span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div style=\"margin: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div style=\"margin: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div style=\"margin: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"></span></span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif;\"></span><br />\n<div>\n<br style=\"text-align: start;\" /></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<br /></div>\n"
  },
